questions.q:
下面代码的输出是？
```js
for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
  setTimeout(() => console.log(i), 0);
}
```

浏览器中以普通脚本（非严格模式、非模块）执行下面代码，输出是？
```js
var title = 'global';
const obj = {
  title: 'obj',
  hi() { return this.title; },
  arrow: () => this.title
};
console.log(obj.hi(), obj.arrow());
```

下面代码的输出是？
```js
function F() {}
F.prototype.a = 1;
const o = new F();
console.log(o.a, o.hasOwnProperty('a'), 'a' in o, o.constructor === F);
```

下面代码的输出顺序是？
```js
console.log('1');
setTimeout(() => console.log('2'), 0);
Promise.resolve().then(() => console.log('3'));
queueMicrotask(() => console.log('4'));
console.log('5');
```

下面代码的输出顺序是？
```js
async function f() {
  console.log('a');
  await null;
  console.log('b');
}
console.log('c');
f();
console.log('d');
```
